	["DictKey_descriptionBlueTask_3"] = "PLAYER SLOTS (group / call sign / aircraft / start)\nCAS-1 / HORNET 51 / F/A-18C / CVN-73 deck, cold. The scored hero slot (Player_01), with the CAS-1 kneeboard and scripted comms.\nPOP-4 / HORNET 41 / F/A-18C / Incirlik, cold\nTOMCAT-2 / CHEVY 21 / F-14B / Incirlik, cold\nPHANTOM-1 / FORD 11 / F-4E / Incirlik, cold\nPOP-3 / VIPER 51 / F-16C / Incirlik, cold\nTIGER-1 / COLT 31 / F-5E / Incirlik, cold\nHORNET-467 / DODGE 11 / F/A-18C / Diyarbakir, hot\nPOP-1 / VIPER 31 / F-16C / airborne over Cyprus\nPOP-2 / SQUID 11 / F/A-18C / airborne over Cyprus\nSEAD-1 / STING 11 / F/A-18C / airborne off Latakia, 24,000 ft\nAerial-1 / COLT 11 / F/A-18C / airborne inland, 24,000 ft\nScoring covers Player_01 only.\n\nCARRIER - CVN-73\nTACAN 72X WSH, ICLS 12, Link 4 337.000, ACLS. DCS carrier ATC is not used; AIRBOSS runs Marshal 261.000 and LSO 262.000. CAS-1 scripted nets: Departure 269.000, Strike 265.000, Approach 263.000.\nCASE II/III Marshal: R-196 / 25 DME / angels 10.\n\nAWACS\nOVERLORD 11, E-2C, 253.100 (DCS AWACS). The scripted OVERLORD of CAS-1 talks on 251.100.\nMAGIC 21, E-3A, 251.200.\n\nTANKERS (frequency / TACAN)\nTEXACO 11, KC-130, 252.100 / 21Y\nARCO 21, KC-135 MPRS, 252.200 / 22Y\nARCO 31, A-6E, 252.300 / 23Y (CVN recovery tanker)\nSHELL 41, KC-135, 252.400 / 24Y\nSHELL 61, KC-135, 252.600 / 26Y\n\nJTAC / FAC\nScripted JTACs of CAS-1 (OVERLORD tasks two per sortie, laser 1688): POINTER 11 333.300, EYEBALL 11 333.400, AXEMAN 11 333.500, DARKNIGHT 11 333.100 (an MQ-9, FAC-1, lases).\nDCS AFAC: UZI 21, MQ-9 (FAC-2), 333.200.\n\nAMBIENT RADIO (listen only, AM)\nRange and ATC recordings: 128.100-129.000 and 266.100-267.100 (0.1 MHz steps), 305.500.\nIncirlik ATIS: 129.750 and 267.200.\n\nDIVERT FIELDS\nIncirlik (LTAG): TACAN 21X, ILS 05 109.3, tower 360.100.\nAkrotiri (LCRA): tower 252.000.",
